{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Context Store.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Context Store.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender context store blender context store","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Context Store.md","fileName":"Blender Context Store.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Context Store","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender Library and Kernel Internals]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Library and Kernel Internals","Blender bContext Structure","Blender CTX API","Blender PointerRNA","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Context Store.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Context Store.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender context store blender context store","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Context Store.md","fileName":"Blender Context Store.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Context Store","heading":"Blender Context Store","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A Blender context store associates names with RNA pointers so temporary or UI-specific values can be attached to the current context. CTX functions can add one value, combine complete stores, install a store on a context, copy it, and free individual stores or lists.\n\nThis mechanism extends the [[Blender bContext Structure]] without exposing its fields directly. It works through the [[Blender CTX API]] and uses [[Blender PointerRNA]] objects so context-dependent code can carry typed references alongside ordinary window and scene state.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Library and Kernel Internals","Blender bContext Structure","Blender CTX API","Blender PointerRNA","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"p